  "description": "Bring festive charm to your creative projects with this Christmas Seamless Pattern Bundle. This collection includes 21 beautifully designed Christmas patterns, perfect for adding a cozy and cheerful holiday touch to your projects.\n**What’s Included:**\n• 21 Christmas seamless pattern designs\n• JPG files\n• PNG files\n• High-quality digital files\n• Seamless/repeating patterns\nPerfect for scrapbooking, stationery, invitations, cards, gift wrapping, fabric projects, sublimation designs, crafts, backgrounds, digital products, and other creative holiday projects.\nCreate beautiful Christmas-themed designs with this versatile collection of festive seamless patterns.",
